  - m_Id: 15962387096530944
    m_Localized: Tomato soup
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15959978559401984
    m_Localized: Hank would have liked it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15960262295678976
    m_Localized: The most dangerous cold weapon according to popculture
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962022108196864
    m_Localized: It's pizza time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15960382458294272
    m_Localized: A piece of metal in the shape of jelly. About two years were spent
      on this development
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961992353804288
    m_Localized: For a fun evening
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961866461769728
    m_Localized: "Contains no alcohol (we don\u2019t need any trouble)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961159667019776
    m_Localized: 'One rule: under no circumstances should you say which country it
      was invented in'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961480191537152
    m_Localized: Not French
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961510109507584
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ll need to crack a couple of eggs"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961448579067904
    m_Localized: Has nothing to do with crabs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961610294652928
    m_Localized: "Life didn\u2019t give you lemons, so buy lemonade from us"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961234149470208
    m_Localized: Spices with potato content
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961698094018560
    m_Localized: Made from processed bones and sunflower oil, kids should like it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961810522337280
    m_Localized: Stop writing that you need to use carrots in the recipe! And seriously,
      what even is this "carrot" of yours?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962051896143872
    m_Localized: The Chinese government is definitely not involved in this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962306121297920
    m_Localized: 'If you''re a fan of this sort of thing, please contact us at this
      number: +1 646-766-4000'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962453010018304
    m_Localized: The perfect choice for surviving a nuclear apocalypse with the whole
      family!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961267691319296
    m_Localized: Rich old mans love to slip their golden tickets into such things
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961300381724672
    m_Localized: Keep this away from parrots! We're tired of getting lawsuits!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961572617220096
    m_Localized: Contains a small fragment of endless suffering
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15960340519448576
    m_Localized: Very ice machine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15960418856464384
    m_Localized: Whistle baby, whistle baby
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961193833820160
    m_Localized: Feel like a camel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962266569011200
    m_Localized: Do not mix with mushrooms!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15960693419798528
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961101559132160
    m_Localized: The design with a cartoon face was canceled due to the occurrence
      of nightmares beyond comprehension
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961133217738752
    m_Localized: Tastes like blueberry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961334024237056
    m_Localized: Better than cocoa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961408473133056
    m_Localized: Unlike its namesake, managed to conquer the world
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961545685594112
    m_Localized: Unlike french fries, it contains potatoes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961772584857600
    m_Localized: No animals were harmed in the making of this dish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962137699020800
    m_Localized: We do NOT use any Stewies in the recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961908748742656
    m_Localized: Death from brain freeze is possible
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15961956274401280
    m_Localized: Made from starch and animal bones. And it jiggles in a fun way too
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962088713744384
    m_Localized: Tastes like a very rich fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962229835296768
    m_Localized: We don't care that these are sushi rolls, who even cares?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15962189238628352
    m_Localized: They started putting their meat into everything...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
